Hi<P>

I was expecting that a prototype <C>sub foo(&)</C> will parse <C>foo {$x}</C> with precedence <C>foo(sub {$x})</C> but ...<P>


<c>
use strict;
use warnings;

sub foo (&){ }
sub bar {}


my ($Q,$t) = (10,2);

bar ($Q) + bar ($t);

foo {$Q} + foo {$t}; # line 12

</c><P>

